    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TORN DIVIDER -->
  <div class="ty-divider" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 88" preserveAspectRatio="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <path d="M0,0 L0,52 C120,88 240,28 360,56 C480,84 600,20 720,48 C840,76 960,22 1080,50 C1200,78 1320,30 1440,58 L1440,0 Z" fill="#F4F6F9"/>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <!-- CONFIRMATION -->
  <section class="ty-confirm" aria-labelledby="ty-confirm-heading">
    <div class="ty-confirm__inner">
      <div class="ty-confirm__icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
      <h2 class="section-title" id="ty-confirm-heading">Message Sent Successfully</h2>
      <p>We've received your enquiry and one of our team will be back to you shortly — usually within a few hours during business hours.</p>
      <p>In the meantime, feel free to give us a ring directly on <a href="tel:+353873566934" style="color:var(--pd-accent);font-weight:700;">+353 87 356 6934</a> if you'd prefer to chat straight away.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT HAPPENS NEXT -->
  <section class="ty-steps" aria-labelledby="ty-steps-heading">
    <div class="ty-steps__inner">
      <div class="ty-steps__heading">
        <span class="eyebrow">What Happens Next</span>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="ty-steps-heading">Here's What To Expect</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="ty-steps__grid">
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-card__num">01</div>
          <div class="step-card__title">We Review</div>
          <p>We read every enquiry carefully so we can give you a relevant, accurate quote — not a vague number.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-card__num">02</div>
          <div class="step-card__title">We Call You</div>
          <p>A member of our team will ring or email you to confirm the details and arrange a site visit if needed.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-card__num">03</div>
          <div class="step-card__title">Free Quote</div>
          <p>You'll get a clear, written quote — no hidden costs, no pressure. Just honest pricing from a trusted local team.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- REVIEW BAND 
  <section class="ty-review" aria-label="Customer review">
    <div class="ty-review__inner">
      <div class="ty-review__stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div>
      <p class="ty-review__quote">"Kevin and the team were brilliant to deal with, very professional job with updates throughout. We are delighted with the new outdoor space!"</p>
      <span class="ty-review__author">— Kimberly, Tipp · 5.0 ★ Google Review</span>
    </div>
  </section>
-->
  <!-- CTA BAND -->
  <section class="ty-cta" aria-labelledby="ty-cta-heading">
    <div class="ty-cta__inner">
      <h2 class="ty-cta__heading" id="ty-cta-heading">Can't Wait? Call Us Now</h2>
      <p>Kilkenny's trusted painting team — exterior, interior, and roof painting done right. We'd love to hear about your project.</p>
      <div class="ty-cta__btns">
        <a href="tel:+353873566934" class="btn btn--white">📞 +353 87 356 6934</a>
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--outline-white">Back to Contact</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
{% endblock %}